35	// session_privacy.go is Phase 4 (privacy, exclusion, and deletion) of the
36	// conversational-memory plan: brain-local session tombstones understood before
37	// derived indexing, plus list/exclude/include/purge administration with
38	// dry-run.
39	//
40	// Authority model: the tombstone is brain-local (the plan's resolved default
41	// until a capture-layer exclusion contract exists in the Entire CLI). Purge
42	// physically deletes the brain's LOCAL projections (the exported transcript
43	// copy under sessions/ and every derived store built from it), and the
44	// tombstone prevents re-indexing even if a later `refresh sessions` re-exports
45	// the still-canonical captured material. Deleting the canonical capture itself
