72				// for want of local checkpoint bytes, so the cached copy is the
73				// only one left and no recovery proof can succeed. Retaining it
74				// here is what keeps the next export -- which no longer finds the
75				// session listed -- from sweeping it as a stale export.
76				retain(file.Rel, "the session was skipped because its checkpoint transcript is unavailable")
